<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan CPI index falls 0.8 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Moroccan CPI index falls 0.8 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Consumer Price Index fell by 0.8 percent in July to 146.8 points from 147.9 the previous month, the Statistics Directorate said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the main fall came in food products which recorded a drop of 1.6 percent, with transport and communications falling 0.4 percent, and clothing and household equipment rising by 0.2 percent. It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>    MOROCCAN INFLATION    July 1996   June 1996   May 1996</p>
<p>    Monthly change	   -0.8	  -1.1	  +0.8</p>
<p>Basis: 100 points  Year 1989</p>
</text>
